# Internal authoring guidance for Claude Code. Mintlify auto-ignores .claude/
# and README.md, but NOT CLAUDE.md — without this it is built and served at
# /CLAUDE, publicly reachable by anyone with the URL.
CLAUDE.md

# Non-KB articles kept in the repo but deliberately not in navigation.
# Being absent from docs.json only removes a page from the sidebar; it stays
# accessible by URL, so drafts must be excluded from the build explicitly.
drafts/
